# Material-UI in this repo

Do **not** follow generic MUI starter patterns (`createTheme` in the app, `styled()`, `@mui/base`, `.styled.ts`).

This app uses **`@stayfrosty/ui`** via the `@ui` alias.

| Need | Where |
|------|--------|
| Tokens, setup, composites | `packages/ui/README.md` |
| Migrate existing MUI/Emotion UI | `packages/ui/AGENTS.md` |
| Cursor rule | `.cursor/rules/stayfrosty-ui.mdc` |

- Import from `@ui` and `@ui/icons`.
- Style with `sx`. No `styled()`, no `@emotion/styled` in app code.
- Theme lives in `packages/ui/src/theme.ts`. Wrap with `UiProvider`.
- Next App Router: `@mui/material-nextjs` cache is the only allowed `@mui/*` import in app source.
